[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 540.63, "timestamp": "00:09:00", "text": "私がこの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 543.91, "timestamp": "00:09:03", "text": "ゲームをSteamで欲しい唯一の理由です。平均スコアを自慢するためです。どれくらいの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 549.35, "timestamp": "00:09:09", "text": "やり込み要素があるかわかりません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 551.19, "timestamp": "00:09:11", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 552.87, "timestamp": "00:09:12", "text": "わあ、すごい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 555.509, "timestamp": "00:09:15", "text": "うん、実際はスムーズだね。 ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 558.056, "timestamp": "00:09:18", "text": "本当に滑らかだ。  [笑い声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 558.79, "timestamp": "00:09:18", "text": "[息を呑む音]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 563.43, "timestamp": "00:09:23", "text": "120fpsみたいに感じる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 575.11, "timestamp": "00:09:35", "text": "。 え、それって60号線だったの？ とんでもない。 それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 577.509, "timestamp": "00:09:37", "text": "60の設定だった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 582.47, "timestamp": "00:09:42", "text": "いや、中設定だ。 何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 585.35, "timestamp": "00:09:45", "text": "そんなに？ おお。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 587.91, "timestamp": "00:09:47", "text": "待って、そこには2つのパフォーマンスが収録されている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 590.15, "timestamp": "00:09:50", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 593.03, "timestamp": "00:09:53", "text": "待って、高いところを見たい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 598.07, "timestamp": "00:09:58", "text": "GPU の 47%、50% をお待ちください。 何？"}]